Third-party code
================

Verdant is MIT licensed; see LICENSE. This file records the code in or around
this repository that is somebody else's, so that the licence above is not read
as covering it.

The Solidity dependencies are not distributed here. `packages/contracts/vendor/`
holds Uniswap's v4-core, v4-periphery, OpenZeppelin, Solmate and forge-std,
fetched at pinned commits by `scripts/vendor-contracts-deps.sh` and gitignored —
39 MB that never enters version control. Each of those projects carries its own
licence, which travels with it.

`packages/contracts/test/utils/HookMiner.sol` is Uniswap's, under its own MIT
licence, and is the one third-party file committed here rather than fetched. Its
original header is intact.

The typeface is Inter Tight, served from this origin by `next/font` and licensed
under the SIL Open Font License.
